#: ../../source/faq.rst:5
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:8
msgid "What is QET?"
msgstr "QET 是什么？"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:10
msgid ""
"**QET** (QElectroTech) is a cross-platform free and open-source (FOSS) tool "
"allowing you to create electrical, hydraulic and pneumatic drawings."
msgstr "**QET** (QElectroTech) 是一款跨平台、自由且开源（FOSS）的工具，可用于绘制电气、液压和气动图纸。"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:11
msgid ""
"These drawings are essential tools for Electricians and Electrical Engineers"
" alike, allowing them to easily identify components and connections of a "
"electrical circuit."
msgstr "这类图纸是电工和电气工程师的重要工具，可帮助他们轻松识别电气回路中的元件与连接。"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:14
msgid "Why does </feature> isn't yet implemented?"
msgstr "为什么 </feature> 尚未实现？"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:16
msgid ""
"Contrary to proprietary drawing software, QET is a a hobby project created "
"by `the QElectroTech Team <https://qelectrotech.org/contact.php>`_. As we "
"are a small developer team, we sadly do not have the capacity to implement "
"every feature that our users propose."
msgstr ""
"与专有绘图软件不同，QET 是由 `QElectroTech 团队 <https://qelectrotech.org/contact.php>`_ "
"开发的业余项目。由于我们只是一个小型开发团队，很遗憾没有能力实现用户提出的每一项功能。"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:19
msgid ""
"That said, if you have some experience in C programming or with `QT "
"<https://doc.qt.io/>`_ and are willing to implement a feature for QET, "
"please do. We welcome contributions and have a `dedicated entry "
"<developer/index>`_ in the documentation explaining you how to setup a dev "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"话虽如此，如果你有一定的 C 语言编程经验，或熟悉 `Qt <https://doc.qt.io/>`_，并且愿意为 QET "
"实现某项功能，欢迎动手。我们欢迎贡献，文档中有一个 `专门章节 <developer/index>`_ 介绍如何搭建开发环境。"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:23
msgid "How long has QET been in existence?"
msgstr "QET 存在多久了？"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:25
msgid ""
"The project began in October 2006 in the form of small experiments. However,"
" due to the development team's other involvement in OSS, the project's time "
"estimation isn't very precise."
msgstr "该项目于 2006 年 10 月以小型实验的形式起步。不过，由于开发团队还参与了其他开源项目，项目的时间估算并不十分精确。"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:29
msgid "When is the next version of QElectroTech scheduled for release?"
msgstr "QElectroTech 的下一个版本计划何时发布？"

#: ../../source/faq.rst:30
msgid ""
"Although one of the mottos of open source software is “Release early, "
"release often,” the development team takes the time to fine-tune the "
"software before each release. As a result, it no longer even attempts to set"
" a target date (which would inevitably be missed) for the next release. The "
"next version of QElectroTech will therefore be released “When it's done.”"
msgstr ""
"尽管开源软件的口号之一是“尽早发布，频繁发布”，但开发团队会在每次发布前花时间对软件进行打磨。因此，他们甚至不再为下一个版本设定目标日期（那注定会被错过）。所以，QElectroTech"
" 的下一个版本将在“完成之时”发布。"
